# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Clara AI RAG — Docker Build Context Exclusions
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Reduces build context size and prevents secrets from leaking into the image.

# Dependencies (re-installed in build stage)
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnp
.pnp.js

# Build outputs
.next
out
build
dist

# Version control
.git
.gitignore

# Environment & secrets (NEVER include in image)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/

# IDE & editor files
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Documentation & scratch files
Doc/
*.md
!README.md
old_hook.txt
VoiceChatModal_before_patch.txt

# CI/CD (not needed in image)
.github
.trunk

# Testing
coverage
playwright-report
test-results

# Misc
.antigravityignore
16.8.0
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
